Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Right-click (or the palette): 選取同型別（整頁） selects every component of
the same VCL class as the selection (every TLabel of the page ...),
選取同型別（同一層） only those in its container (the one Ctrl+A uses: an
ancestor with an id, a tab sheet, the form). The selection stays the
primary; components hidden in the designer (the eye) are left out; the
status line says how many. With R30 one change in the properties panel
then goes to all of them.

- probe: contOf is now shared (Ctrl+A and this); selectSameType; a new
  'note' message for a plain status line (the host shows it, keeps
  lastNote)
- tests: probe (every button made a TSpeedButton: page scope = all of them,
  container scope = only those beside Save, Save stays primary, the note),
  smoke (both commands reach the probe), real VS Code (IR classes: spbSave
  -> spbSave + sbtExit, "選取了 2 個 TSpeedButton").

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
